0..61 Comment "//! No case tells the two orders of a commutative meet apart."
62..65 Comment "//!"
66..142 Comment "//! The apartness of two terms gives a value of the type with no value. So a"
143..218 Comment "//! wrong apartness makes each statement provable. The two orders of a meet"
219..294 Comment "//! are one term, and a rule that tears under the symmetry decides nothing."
295..298 Comment "//!"
299..375 Comment "//! The checker compares two terms in each order of the arguments of a meet."
376..449 Comment "//! It refuses a case with no arm where one order joins the two terms. It"
450..513 Comment "//! refuses each such case where a pair of rules does not join."
514..517 Comment "//!"
518..534 Comment "//! - see: #8323"
536..559 Comment "// `Hollow` and `Pick`."
